"coder_notes":"Early phase 1 microdevice releasing microdoses of about 20 drugs into tumour in situ; each drug tested separately in reservoirs but all registered in one experimental arm, so coded experimental_combination (could arguably be monotherapy-like per drug). Temozolomide and lomustine are established GBM therapies delivered by a new route (microdose) so coded established_therapy_experiment; candidates exist among the others. Microdevice is a device-enabled delivery so device_dependent true throughout. Opdualag split into nivolumab + relatlimab; nivolumab also listed separately. Tumour PK (drug concentration) not explicitly stated, so no. Quote for role evidence from interventions field."}
